// Intitialize the project via the command:-
- dotnet new console -n <project-name>

// Compile command :-
1. dotnet run (from root dir)
2. csc filename (manual command)

// Learning :-
- C# 14 and .NET 10
- Asp.Net cor MVC
- Database connectivity: Entity Framework Core
- AI based application: ML .NET
- Cloud based application: Azure

- C# is an Object Oriented Programming Language in which the program made by following up the Class and Object.

// Program Execution :-
- hello.cs Program  --->>>
- Compiler converts this file to .exe(binary executable) file in which there is a CIL(Common Intermediate Language) code  --->>> 
- CLR(Common Language Runtime) execute your .exe file on the OS and in CLR we have one component called JIT (they basically re-compile and convert into the Machine Code). --->>>
- And operating system provide us the Output

// Type of Runtime software :- 
- Java programs run on the JVM (Java Virtual Machine).
- C# programs run on the CLR (Common Language Runtime).